  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of 15 stories from the madman Hideshi Hino. Stories 1-11 appeared in the monthly horror magazine Pandora from 1989-1990. Stories 12-15 are culled from various magazines from 1986-1990.\n\n#1 The Brain Demon and the Maggot Snake // 脳魔鬼、蛆蛇\n#2 The Funeral of the Deceased //死者の葬列\n#3 The Devil's Fetus Fish //魔胎魚\n#4 The Skeleton Doll //骨人形\n#5 Black Christmas // ブラック・クリスマス\n#6 Snow Skull // 雪どくろ\n#7 The Alien Egg // エイリアン・エッグ\n#8 The Impish Hina Doll // 鬼子雛\n#9 The Flowering Corpse // 花屍\n#10 Aquatic Gaki // 水餓鬼\n#11 Rot Bugs // 腐乱虫\n#12 Flesh in a Bottle // 瓶詰の肉塊\n#13 The Strangest Pachinko Parlor // 世にも怪奇なパチンコ屋\n#14 Turning Face // いまわしの顔\n#15 In the Sea of Deformed Wombs // 奇胎の海"
  },
